    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "hook_gov_t",
      "x": 404,
      "y": 217,
      "width": 412,
      "height": 228,
      "text": "canonical-sdlc-governing-skill.sh\nPreToolUse · Write, Edit\n\nBLOCKING ladder:\n1  YAML frontmatter present\n2  canonical_sdlc_version == 13\n3  triple present + enum-valid\n      intent · rigor · scale\n4  no mode: line  (split-brain guard)\n5  intent × scale not a barred cell\n6  discriminators + opt-in + model_plan\n7  ## Verification Matrix  (plan, step ≥ 3)",
      "originalText": "canonical-sdlc-governing-skill.sh\nPreToolUse · Write, Edit\n\nBLOCKING ladder:\n1  YAML frontmatter present\n2  canonical_sdlc_version == 13\n3  triple present + enum-valid\n      intent · rigor · scale\n4  no mode: line  (split-brain guard)\n5  intent × scale not a barred cell\n6  discriminators + opt-in + model_plan\n7  ## Verification Matrix  (plan, step ≥ 3)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
