      "text": "canonical-sdlc-evidence-gate.sh\nPreToolUse · Bash (git commit)\n\nBLOCKING ladder:\n1  newest plan → ## SDLC State (fence-aware)\n2  canonical_sdlc_version == 13\n3  current: N   or   current: T<n>\n      (T<n> = scale: task → ledger check)\n4  Step N: evidence line present\n5  evidence non-empty + non-placeholder\n6  per-step shape fields  (4 · 5 · 7 · 8 · 9)\n7  ## Verification Matrix  (step 5, prefix 6–9)",
      "originalText": "canonical-sdlc-evidence-gate.sh\nPreToolUse · Bash (git commit)\n\nBLOCKING ladder:\n1  newest plan → ## SDLC State (fence-aware)\n2  canonical_sdlc_version == 13\n3  current: N   or   current: T<n>\n      (T<n> = scale: task → ledger check)\n4  Step N: evidence line present\n5  evidence non-empty + non-placeholder\n6  per-step shape fields  (4 · 5 · 7 · 8 · 9)\n7  ## Verification Matrix  (step 5, prefix 6–9)",
