      "x": 1346,
      "y": 396,
      "width": 364,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "LOG-ONLY findings — never block the wave.\nOne line per finding + an stderr echo.\nPromotion to blocking is a later decision,\nmade by the user from this data.\n\ngoverning-skill checks:  intent-floor ·\n    spike-cap · project-floor · epic-floor\nevidence-gate checks:  task-ledger ·\n    merge-target · refactor-evidence ·\n    tune-evidence",
