      "id": "version_note",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 1096,
      "width": 822,
      "height": 140.4,
      "text": "One supported version\n\ncanonical_sdlc_version: 13 is the only value either hook accepts.\nAny other value — older, empty, or malformed — exits 2 naming the\nvalue found. There is no version dispatch and no silent pass-through.\n\nBoth hooks read the same marker; the governing-skill hook gates the\nartifact write, the evidence-gate hook gates the commit.",
